.TH SION 1 "2026" "Sion" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sion \- native diagramming and digital illustration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sion
.RI [ FILE "...]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Sion
opens directly onto a canvas. Shapes get useful typography, shadows, and
connection magnets by default; connectors preview their routed path before
placement. Drawings are saved as
.I .sion
archives that the macOS and Linux applications share.
.PP
Each
.I FILE
given on the command line opens in its own window. Without arguments a new,
untitled drawing opens.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/Sion/Library
The library shared by all documents.
.TP
.I /usr/share/sion/help/index.html
The user guide, opened by Help > Sion Help.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://github.com/L-K-M/Sion
The Sion repository
.UE
